{"id": "t118-001", "text": "Fang's mum fell on the ice and broke her wrist in two places, surgery Thursday morning at 8. Fang's driving up the night before and staying the week to look after her, her dad can't really cope on his own since his hip. She sounded pretty frazzled. Remind me to text her that afternoon to see how it went", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fang", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "broke her wrist", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surgery", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday morning at 8", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fang", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't really cope on his own", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "since his hip"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty frazzled", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "that afternoon", "anchor": "a1"}]}
