{"id": "t118-051", "text": "So Chidi was telling me about his sister Miriam, she's pregnant with her third and they've only just moved house, like two weeks ago. She's due in about six weeks and the nursery isn't even painted. He's going down this weekend to help out. I said I'd ask how the move's settling. Remind me to message Miriam next week, and send something for the baby when it comes", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chidi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Miriam", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved house", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "like two weeks ago", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in about six weeks", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going down", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message Miriam", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Miriam", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send something for the baby", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "when it comes", "anchor": "a2"}]}
